  "description": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"58\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"58\">JBL Subwoofer + Versterker Set | Nette staat | €149,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"355\">Deze <strong data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"110\">JBL subwoofer met bijbehorende versterker</strong> is een complete <strong data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"144\">auto-audioset</strong> voor krachtige en diepe basweergave. Ideaal voor wie zijn autosoundsysteem wil upgraden met extra vermogen en betere lage tonen. De set verkeert in <strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"308\">nette staat</strong>, is volledig getest en technisch 100% in orde.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"376\"><strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"374\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<li data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"390\">\r\n<p data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"390\">Merk: JBL</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"437\">\r\n<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"437\">Type: Auto subwoofer + subwooferversterker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"483\">\r\n<p data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"483\">Subwoofer: JBL subwoofer (model onbekend)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"523\">\r\n<p data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"523\">Versterker: JBL subwooferversterker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"550\">\r\n<p data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"550\">Toepassing: Auto-audio</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"613\">\r\n<p data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"613\">Aansluitingen: RCA / speaker level (afhankelijk van model)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"689\">\r\n<p data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"689\">Behuizing subwoofer: Gesloten of basreflex (afhankelijk van uitvoering)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"732\">Toestand: Nette staat, volledig getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"751\"><strong data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"749\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<li data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"769\">JBL subwoofer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"788\">\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"788\">JBL versterker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"821\">Set in nette, werkende staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"838\"><strong data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"836\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<li data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<p data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"879\">Complete set: subwoofer + versterker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"906\">Krachtige en diepe bas</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n<p data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"936\">Betrouwbare JBL-kwaliteit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"976\">Ideaal voor upgrade van autosysteem</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1020\">Volledig getest en direct gebruiksklaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1043\"><strong data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1031\">Prijs</strong><br data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1034\">€149,99</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1168\"><strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1069\">Ophalen of verzenden</strong><br data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1072\">Afhalen bij <strong data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1113\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong>. Verzending mogelijk; de set wordt zorgvuldig verpakt.</p>",
